# Zovus AI harness

For product implementation or an explicitly requested execution audit, follow the canonical `.agents/skills/zovus-harness/SKILL.md`. Choose existing checks and independent reviews for the actual task and changed files. Full audit mode is explicit; read-only analysis and documentation-only work do not require a machine PASS merely to finish.

Reuse current passing evidence. Rerun verification after relevant code/environment changes or new findings; do not repeat the same failed command while an unchanged blocker remains. Report unavailable required checks as PARTIAL. For covered implementation/audit execution, COMPLETED still requires fresh machine PASS and required independent reviews for the current workspace fingerprint, with production PASS or NOT_REQUIRED. Do not bypass failed, missing or stale required evidence.
